          },
          "nascent": {
            "label": "Nascent",
            "description": "Most of a savant's magical prowess comes from their attunement, an powerful innate magic called Nascent Magic. Nascent spells can be cast by spending Focus points instead of spell slots. Nascent cantrips are special spells that you gain from your attunement, and don't cost focus points to cast."
